L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|98|-9|LeidenJson(maxLevels=10,gamma,tol,topK=10000,memBudgetMB=256,randomSeed=-1) methodimpl { s:'($d(gamma)#2) gamma=1.0 s:'($d(tol)#2) tol=0.0001
L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|99|-9|    If $Order(^NKG("$NI", "")) = "" Return "ERROR:^NKG not built"
L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|100|-9|    Do ..BuildSymAdj()
L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|101|-9|    Kill ^||ccComm, ^||ccKi, ^||ccCommTot
