L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|204|-9|        If (topK > 0) && (emitted >= topK) Quit
L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|205|-9|    }
L|Graph.KG.Communities.1|206|-9|    Kill ^||ccAdj, ^||ccComm, ^||ccKi, ^||ccCommTot, ^||ccCommSize, ^||ccCommMembers, ^||ccCommBySize, ^||ccLinks
