L|Graph.KG.Eraser.1|703|0|	// Every routed table the catalog knows, claimed or not: each is visited with a
L|Graph.KG.Eraser.1|704|0|	// graph predicate, so another graph's vectors are never touched, and an orphan
L|Graph.KG.Eraser.1|705|0|	// route's FK on (graph_id, node_id) blocks the nodes DELETE just as a claimed
