L|Graph.KG.LedgerApply.1|444|-9|    //
L|Graph.KG.LedgerApply.1|445|-9|    // The key is derived from the relationship's own graph. Hardcoding 0 refreshed
L|Graph.KG.LedgerApply.1|446|-9|    // the default graph's weight for a change made in a named graph: the named
L|Graph.KG.LedgerApply.1|447|-9|    // graph kept the stale weight and a graph the changeset never mentioned moved.
