L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|105|0|    }
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|106|0|    // Also pick up nodes only in "in" (no outgoing edges)
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|107|0|    Set node = ""
