L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|151|0|    }
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|152|0|    Set merged = ##class(Graph.KG.GraphIndex).EmptyHLL()
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|153|0|    Kill seen, frontier
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|154|0|    Set seen(sIdx) = ""
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|155|0|    Set frontier(sIdx) = ""
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|156|0|    // Strategy: expand (maxHops-1) hops to reach the "penultimate" frontier,
