L|Graph.KG.TraversalBFS.1|334|1|        If p = "" Quit
L|Graph.KG.TraversalBFS.1|335|0|        Do ..TraverseWithPredicateFast(pGraph, s, p, hop, maxHops, nextP, dstLabel, .count, .nextFrontier, .seen)
L|Graph.KG.TraversalBFS.1|336|0|    } }
L|Graph.KG.TraversalBFS.1|337|0|TraverseAllPredicatesFastInboun(pGraph,s,hop,count,nextFrontier,seen) methodimpl {
